  "The SigmaTel transmit FIFO did not empty.": ["Le tampon FIFO d’émission du SigmaTel ne s’est pas vidé.", "SigmaTels FIFO-sändbuffert tömdes inte.", "Il buffer FIFO di trasmissione del SigmaTel non si è svuotato.", "De FIFO-zendbuffer van de SigmaTel is niet leeggelopen.", "O buffer FIFO de transmissão do SigmaTel não esvaziou.", "SigmaTel 송신 FIFO가 비워지지 않았습니다.", "SigmaTel 的傳輸 FIFO 緩衝區未清空。", "لم يُفرغ مخزن إرسال FIFO في SigmaTel."],
